inks against. Dashed = compile flags only, propagated to every target that links clean-core. Vulkan, OpenXR, SGL and ImGui arrive in M2 and M5." style="text;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#5A626E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="710" width="1080" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>